    {
      "text": "顶部条带“RMF Steps”：Prepare、Categorize、Select、Implement、Assess、Authorize、Monitor，并有一支“Expansion of Strategy”箭头从 Monitor 回到 Prepare。底部条带：“Assessment”（System Inventory、User Inventory、Business Process Review），然后是“Risk Assessment & Policy Development”、“Deployment”、“Operations”，并有一支“Change/Upgrade/Migration Feedback”箭头从 Operations 回到 Assessment。向零信任的迁移被表示为一个与 NIST Risk Management Framework 对照的循环。",
